{"id":"word:hebrew:H929","type":"word","title":"בְּהֵמָה","subtitle":"H929 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, a dumb beast; especially any large quadruped or animal (often collective)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to בְּהֵמָה (H929) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 190 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"בְּהֵמָה (bᵉhêmâh) means properly, a dumb beast; especially any large quadruped or animal (often collective) First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 5 13."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"בְּהֵמָה","transliteration":"bᵉhêmâh","pronunciation":"be-hay-maw'","strong":"H929","lemmaId":"hebrew:H929","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["בְּהֵמָ֑ה","בְּהֵמָ֖ה","הַ/בְּהֵמָה֙","הַ/בְּהֵמָ֔ה","הַ/בְּהֵמָ֖ה"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncfsa",43],["HNcfsa",41],["HC/Ncfsa",16],["HC/Rd/Ncfsa",15],["HRd/Ncfsa",10],["HC/R/Ncfsc",7],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",6],["HNcfpa",6],["HR/Ncfsa",6],["HC/Td/Ncfsa",5]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, a dumb beast; especially any large quadruped or animal (often collective)","usage":"beast, cattle.","full":"H929. behemah בְּהֵמָה 187 noun feminine beast, animal, cattle (Arabic ) — ׳בּ Gen 1:24 137t.; construct בֶּהֱמַת Num 3:41 (twice in verse) + 10 t.; suffix בְּהֶמְתְּךָ Lev 19:19 4 t.; בְּהֶמְתֶּ֑ךָ Exod 20:10 4 t.; בְּהֶמְתּוֺ Gen 36:6 ; Prov 12:10 ; plural absolute בְּהֵמוֺת Deut 32:24 6 t. + Psa 73:22 (see below); construct בַּהֲמוֺת 8:8 5 t.; — beast , & collective beasts ( Gen 8:1 + very often) 1 of living creatures other than man ( אָדָם ) Gen 8:1 ; Exod 8:13 ; 8:14 ; 9:9-10 , 22 ; 22:18 ; Lev 18:23 (twice in verse) (where ׳בּ is male, so 20:16 ) Deut 27:21 ; Psa 36:7 etc.; בּ וְעַד ׳מֵאָדָם ( ׳בּ including all the larger animals) Exod 9:25 ; 12:12 ; Psa 135:8 ; Jer 50:3 etc.; as inferior to man Job 18:3 ; Psa 49:13 ; Psalm 49:21, so also Eccl 3:18-19 , (twice in verse); 3:21 ; opposed to also birds & reptiles Gen 6:7 ; 7:23 ; 8:17 compare Ezek 44:31 etc.; also to fishes 1Kin 5:13 ; Job 12:7 compare 12:8 , Psa 8:9 ; Zeph 1:3 . 2 opposed to also to wild beasts ׳ח הַשָּׂדֶה הָאָרֶץ, חַיַּת Gen 1:24-25 , 26 ; 2:20 ; 3:14 ; 7:14 , 21 ; 9:10 ; Psa 50:10 ; 148:10 ; Isa 46:1 etc.; especially therefore cattle , as owned and used by man, Gen 47:18 ( הַבּ ׳מִקְנֵה ) Exod 20:10 = Deut 5:14 ; Lev 19:19 ; 26:22 ; Num 3:41 (twice in verse); 3:45 (twice in verse); Deut 2:35 ; 11:15 ; Jonah 4:11 ; Zech 2:8 ; 8:10 ; 14:15 ; Ezra 1:4 , 6 ; Neh 9:37 ; 10:37 etc.; in one (late) passage of animal for riding (horse ? mule ?) 2:12 (twice in verse); 2:14 . 3 rarely of wild beasts , especially carnivora, ׳בּ יַעַר Micah 5:7 ; ׳בּ הָאָרֶץ Deut 28:26 ; Isa 18:6 (twice in verse); Jer 7:33 ; 15:3 ; 16:4 ; 19:7 ; 34:20 ; ׳בּ הַשָּׂדֶה 1Sam 17:44 ; alone, Prov 30:30 ; שֶׁןבְּֿהֵמוֺת Deut 32:24 ; בּ ׳שֹׁד Hab 2:17 . &#8212; On בְּהֵמוֺת Psa 73:22 compare below","rootNote":"from an unused root (probably meaning to be mute );","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 5 13","keyReferences":["1Kgs 5 13","1Kgs 18 5","1Sam 17 44","2Chr 32 28","2Chr 32 28","2Kgs 3 9","2Kgs 3 17","Deut 2 35"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":190,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 5 13","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בְּהֵמָ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 18 5","book":"1Kgs","chapter":18,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵ/הַ/בְּהֵמָֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Td/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 17 44","book":"1Sam","chapter":17,"verse":44,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/לְ/בֶהֱמַ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 28","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּהֵמָ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 28","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":28,"engli